```
Reason:
The bug occurs because if `platform_get_drvdata(dev)` returns `NULL`, the subsequent code does not assign any error code to `err`, which can lead to undefined behavior or incorrect error reporting when the function is called without valid driver data.

The code statements that fix the bug are:
```c
