    err = -EINVAL;
    goto out;
}
```
Reason:
The fix assigns `-EINVAL` to `err` when `info` is `NULL`, ensuring that an appropriate error code is returned from `physmap_flash_remove()`, thus preventing undefined behavior and improving error handling.

